        <div style=" float:left; margin-top:6.61pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:20pt;white-space:nowrap;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">(1)</font>
          <br >
        </div>
        <div style=" margin-top:6.61pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt; text-align:left; margin-left:20pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">The executive director&#8217;s service agreement is of indefinite duration, subject to termination by the Company or the individual on six&#160;months&#8217; notice. The non-executive director serves for an initial period of 12&#160;months, subject to re-election at each annual general meeting of the Company and is terminable on three&#160;months&#8217; notice given by either party. </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
        <div style="margin-top:9.62pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:-0.2pt;">Senior Management</font><font style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:11.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">The following table sets forth the names and positions of the members of our Senior Management team as of the date of this registration statement. The business address for each member of our Senior Management is c/o&#160;Diversified Energy Company plc, 1600 Corporate Drive, Birmingham, Alabama 35242. </font>
