          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#160;</font>
          <br >
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:6pt;margin-left:69.66pt;width:456pt;">

          <div style="width:456pt; line-height:12.5pt;">
            <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">be increased by 25 basis points. In each case, an independent third-party assurance provider will be required to certify our performance of the above performance targets by the applicable deadlines.</font>
          </div>


          <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:12.5pt;">
            <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Effective December&#160;5, 2023, we executed a 20-for-1 consolidation of our outstanding shares. The pro&#160;forma impact of this consolidation on weighted average shares outstanding and earnings (loss) per share is included within the statements below and shows the impact of treating the consolidation as if it occurred at the beginning of the earliest period presented. </font>
          </div>


