        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:13.5pt; width:456pt; line-height:12.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">To manage our cash flows in a volatile commodity price environment and as required by our SPV-level asset backed securities, we utilize derivative contracts that allow us to fix the per unit sales prices for approximately 80% of our production over the next twelve&#160;months. The tables below set forth the commodity hedge impact on commodity revenue, excluding and including cash received for commodity hedge settlements with natural gas on a per Mcf basis and NGLs and oil on a per Bbl basis: </font>
        </div>
