        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:14.19pt; width:456pt; line-height:12.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">To manage our cash flows in a volatile commodity price environment and as required by our SPV-level asset backed securities, we utilize derivative contracts which allow us to fix the sales prices at a per unit level for approximately 90% of our production to mitigate commodity risk. The tables below set forth the commodity hedge impact on commodity revenue, excluding and including cash received for commodity hedge settlements with natural gas on a per Mcf basis and NGLs and oil on a per Bbl basis: </font>
        </div>
      </div>
