          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">In addition, non-executive directors are reimbursed all necessary and reasonable expenses incurred in connection with the performance of their duties and any tax thereon in accordance with the Company&#8217;s Non-Executive Director Expense Reimbursement Policy. </font>
