          <br >
        </div>
        <div style=" margin-top:6.1pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt; text-align:left; margin-left:30pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Fifth Amendment to Amended, Restated and Consolidated Revolving Credit Agreement, dated January&#160;22, 2020, among Diversified Gas &amp; Oil Corporation, as borrower, KeyBank National Association, as administrative agent, the guarantors party thereto and the lenders party thereto. For a description of this contract, see &#8220;</font><font style="font-style:italic;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Item&#160;5. Operating and Financial Results and Prospects&#8201;&#8212;&#8201;B.&#160;Liquidity and Capital Resources</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">.&#8221; </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
        <div style=" float:left; margin-left:20pt; line-height:12pt; margin-top:6.1pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:10pt;white-space:nowrap;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8226;</font>
          <br >
        </div>
        <div style=" margin-top:6.1pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt; text-align:left; margin-left:30pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Sixth Amendment to Amended, Restated and Consolidated Revolving Credit Agreement, dated March&#160;24, 2020, among Diversified Gas &amp; Oil Corporation, as borrower, KeyBank National Association, as administrative agent, the guarantors party thereto and the lenders party thereto. For a description of this contract, see &#8220;</font><font style="font-style:italic;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Item&#160;5. Operating and Financial Results and Prospects&#8201;&#8212;&#8201;B.&#160;Liquidity and Capital Resources</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">.&#8221; </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
        <div style=" float:left; margin-left:20pt; line-height:12pt; margin-top:6.1pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:10pt;white-space:nowrap;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8226;</font>
          <br >
